WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.900
We don't have a lot of facts.

00:01.900 --> 00:06.780
Remember, these are the same folks who killed a person,

00:06.780 --> 00:11.280
unarmed person, just a couple of weeks ago in Franklin Park.

00:11.280 --> 00:15.400
At first, they said that the officer had been threatened with his life.

00:15.400 --> 00:19.060
The reality of it and the truth of it has now come out.

00:19.060 --> 00:20.760
And that wasn't the case.

00:20.760 --> 00:21.820
They killed somebody.

00:21.820 --> 00:24.780
They are just putting out their propaganda.

00:24.780 --> 00:27.760
And then we've got to later determine what actually happened.

